{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d470876391c2feaf","x":-780,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"1. Eddie is traumatized on using his magic, which need to be lifted, he duelled someone in his youth, and accidentally disfigured him"},
		{"id":"1a4c5b2bc705e3c9","x":-780,"y":20,"width":250,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"2. The Island of Weshaven is having a Monster Infestations, creatures and undead has been going out of the Illusory Forest, and the Argantheian government is sending Paladin Units over to Weshaven to combat the issue."},
		{"id":"b4868b73d7fb5455","x":-780,"y":280,"width":250,"height":184,"type":"text","text":"3. Until the Paladins arrive, the Island need to defend themself from the monsters, by arming the villagers and repel it themself"},
		{"id":"a66396cde5f26dbe","x":-780,"y":464,"width":250,"height":316,"type":"text","text":"4. In order to defend the island, the Mayor called the youths and divided them into different parties, one is given guns from the armoury, and the others are magicians, Eddie chose a gun. The Youth are lead by the island’s guards, since they uses old musket formations."},
		{"id":"45eacd5465651e3a","x":-780,"y":780,"width":250,"height":280,"type":"text","text":"5. But then, there is an uproar, they aren’t sending the Paladin Units, since there is another issue at another region, instead they sent an expert, they should be someone far more capable to respond to Weshaven’s Issue."},
		{"id":"5feaf5ea000fe6c1","x":-780,"y":1060,"width":250,"height":144,"type":"text","text":"6. Catherine came, she spends the time in Eddie’s house, a lighthouse in the far side of the island."},
		{"id":"e7d81edf3e4b4115","x":-780,"y":1204,"width":250,"height":240,"type":"text","text":"7. She needed an Assistant Alchemist. There is no Alchemist in the town other than Mr. Welton, but Mr. Welton is too old to go on these sort of missions. So Eddie have to accept it."},
		{"id":"0cbee1fabd1b7092","x":-780,"y":1444,"width":250,"height":123,"type":"text","text":"8. Eddie accepted, although he still don’t want to use Magic. He carries his gun."},
		{"id":"b95f5d704afab23e","x":-780,"y":1567,"width":250,"height":117,"type":"text","text":"9. In that mission, Eddie is forced to use his Alchemy, because Catherine is down."},
		{"id":"204adb229c158254","x":-780,"y":1684,"width":250,"height":96,"type":"text","text":"10. He went to hospital, and faced his old bully, the old bully forgives him"},
		{"id":"a832f460c5a934ca","x":-780,"y":1780,"width":250,"height":240,"type":"text","text":"11. Catherine told Eddie that she didn’t just came to Weshaven to fix the issue, she came for him. A mysterious benefactor wants to support Eddie’s education to Edenfield University to be come an Alchemist."},
		{"id":"d6d478bae7cea7eb","x":-780,"y":2020,"width":250,"height":82,"type":"text","text":"12. Eddie took on the offer, and sails to Edenfield."},
